                    Portions of the materials used are trademarks and/or copyrighted works of Epic Games, Inc. All rights reserved by Epic. This material is not official and is not endorsed by Epic.
                </p>
            </div>

            <section>
                <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
                <p>
                    By accessing or using Sprite Scout ("the Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the Service.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>2. Unofficial Fan Project & Intellectual Property</h2>
                <p>
                    Sprite Scout is an independent, non-commercial, fan-made checklist and companion tool created for players of Fortnite.
                </p>
