                <p>
                    We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. Continued use of the Service following modifications constitutes your acceptance of the updated Terms.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>8. Contact</h2>
                <p>
                    If you have questions regarding these Terms of Service, please open an issue on the project's GitHub repository or contact the maintainer.
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </section>

    <SiteFooter />
</main>
